{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1443,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b1932f25f820138fca897a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请问怎么了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c40ed3678a968d15bddc83cf062a70ed93af71f796d5b986c4679ba09cab3ccd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "140009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57e9e91edbe8d53bfb9a31de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fea14373030f77fe59b8e828b607a745b9576347d4420757e783504fbaf52ab2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2f0c8772ef62a61ccab7dc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "原来如此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "774e83f471c3e9011cd7982b02e15326ae64a201de6624d2dd233b23945d5205",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f721483d1d591c53259282f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6d09d3bf68ecfe25b03c1bbfa1cc896088838b9b654cf7cddb2ba7226922267",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b7d40661a8d6cd41fe728d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c7a9f97adb5bed9d4c6aca666dffd0e37fda970ebcfc2c8c0060523a483e295",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3aeef69584f1d91fc1a40bf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e34abed1ddb126fde54bfedaf035b92aac16d1e143243cc656102c6ded090c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:808bd2affa5c260d5156f862",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a977ca8e3137e67a7a6918a06d3d86d57fbf577994f726c5155115e0a2b3071a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e350708889ed874eabdc80b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有什么问题吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "22d3e14cfb7c1fde0c4e4540f3fa8c6bf5b3b01d8c5f22a0d765bd7c568cd14d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4f9b8294c08b69247d53f2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔嗯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "34ca3bd0ae861985f839122e2ffd1c1bb718fb26f6a34a4612ecf4d5126977f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b363d67217d93970cb41b454",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真可惜呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b60df796a255a571f43c3ab4a91d20d42107ffba3380c8ff002586864f06da59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b60002f0cca89ecd1e0b605c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天的是这个。请别忘了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d5404bc7b3340c11e38f21ddc90b1a74145da657d69197f32b83cda3d2c5991",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bd481f2053d13a405b89023",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……不，你不需要顾虑我。\r\n时间有限……\r\n我还有该做的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bffec19f9f1e563f8f0411466ad5d7278c78b9eaba7821d50f2f19a784619fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:812a9e322530f118ec6d16c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……\r\n既然背负着家族的荣耀，\r\n我绝对……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a2428c1f3fadf66d1c9c983b21cef9503ed0f8a679f6a3dc3f10b518830044a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02a3d8c5b91918d2d052712e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "保持华丽。保持至高──\r\n这是我永生永世都不会改变的矜持。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0324e0253e9d3335b8bc04c90714b266911acebae2b83aa59c897fc91dfca275",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5390bcb02bb53141a6c3d35f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要为家族争取更大的荣耀，\r\n为此，无论面对多么险阻的困难，\r\n我都不需要除了跨越以外的选项。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f832058285f569f293247b1f5cd94de7e16c278be2438a0c0199d8f578acd212",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:629f418c4f4856e3d8431b4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请指示今天的训练项目。\r\n即使负担会很大也无妨。",
      "source_fingerprint": "269dc0becce31907330bcca01d77dec19afa7ee3801f067c4465301cb7a27f7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e6a757ade5bc118374297b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经准备好了。\r\n请别让我做些\r\n不上不下的训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88620593ef7d5c6c4e057fc1abaf6522fd6e1d0c91e83c9cf5cc9997340981fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d482d0a5eeca349377e426b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你好，\r\n开始训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d58474d1cecdf87ab343e3f8097388d3c7503371a99667358734103bf8412ff4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:180b226e2be8f5f35ec6024a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我对于训练项目\r\n有些建议想提出。\r\n请参考你手边的手册。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa20ad7ae2f3cf2ab6fac7349532d0664c3c14b1d1cea5ce75ce5b57a211b1f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c78c310ec152e55ef30e1784",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的状态……\r\n……必须努力理清原因。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a3e5db9b1f0d57eef069d52cacdba3153314e4daf73c901060e8dac2a51169e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b46743f4a20dc976af3bc3a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……\r\n感情的波澜真是恼人……",
      "source_fingerprint": "159072eed7c595f478b115ce0fc4bf66d917300ed06cb35a0de9c8ebb6c73d84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:261aaecd2edb6a8b2844d970",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不能灰心丧志……\r\n绝对不行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2f3a8a62ad2c2015f854f4d87076f5a3e3aa94b7eb6d45ea2ae5cbf5638dc68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:572f7f6f47e9e51bc4c38ba5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……呼……\r\n就这点程度……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fdcb1a0fc4be069bb6dbd5938e2f80140793959f04cf7b30ec74588e5fa113c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1af45810f567f11f366c11c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你可以说服我，现在将自己\r\n逼得这么紧有什么意义吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8677d7bb5ed2fbc51aa101734d4d0077df3b71e60e5d9508c2d58087ef854608",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c8a20aacf8303415d3f53f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "参赛计划的调整\r\n是你该尽的最低限度的职责\r\n……难道你没有这样的自觉吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfaa276488385f54a86e66ffc30c64acdc0c59756ded55d2f23a0d7add9ec0e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22805aeb004c617a209c3a6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "调整无懈可击。\r\n你完成了自己的职责。\r\n而我，也会完成自己的职责。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39ea1762c6c1c427ac45d99b5dc844de92fd09146d83390b0debc48939e94710",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:805029d37335f5303cb13928",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "保持华丽。保持至高。\r\n……绝不可气馁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b8a0f643fe7382c0cbbee246732b07fdbc64a78e91347a42c58e58cadc6804c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2f4c8232c43acb502b4c236",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标只有一个──绚烂的胜利。\r\n我会赢得与家族相衬的殊荣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5538e6fb09556d608bd629662a09aa1d1e3ad4ac68327c569d26e512523e9086",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4817ac61e83badfd89ebc1bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的比赛……我想应能向\r\n大家报告理所当然的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fae76c9a90948d7c304399b2397bc859d4a2b603b0c21035f4a1c04faf95d8d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37a0e56ad3fffe4981e4f5cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态绝佳。感谢你的努力。\r\n接下来，就由我来完成\r\n自己该完成的职责。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71cb2bae7ee6a69e90c725b047ddaf2557688363e96047884cbc9df4bcb3aeb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:428f3a30a2a12336ef5830fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这一切都是为了我们华丽一族。\r\n母亲……我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cf23d3b509b33f43e78f9de5217421f47968d9b03e909b2c6270d67826ef588",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d068c3fe60a445147e32dd7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态跟我预想的一样。\r\n那么，就出发吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "515b70bdb960a2768d94c31a7d372ba23136930301101e31fffb6abe84392483",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baa0444e180b3e1c46e628c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "时间到了。\r\n那就赛后再见。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41d55de18743fa5607fb8c248c881094f0325851651ea9e74cea2e8e43674cb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:507ce315faf0f7b38cbe66af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也没有任何异常。\r\n再来只需充分发挥实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c519a7fe580ad1ab329c3efea99cbdafcaf6953695c712cae37cf453eab1acf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a89010d56e7f0a5cdbb4eec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身为华丽一族的一员，\r\n理应常保万全状态。\r\n……这是理所当然的职责。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82f52daef218b1360f28ba8364088ce91a675c3c96b98f9bfe2696943c940555",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86bc24d8aa4fc327221d5143",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "逆境才能成为变化的养分。\r\n既然如此，\r\n就让我华丽地克服一切吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "632722d5d2f8cb2d852643701d58056b5e5fb79b745fc160f3960bf526e74f8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e0e539f8ff4f35e81903de1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论什么状况，都不会改变\r\n我背负着家族之名的立场。\r\n……我得坚持到底才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a750c8849174c6abc4d41ab8320ddc389a8106f3fbb393219486c83b87d483f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f7e62b97a6cdc1cc22f9c5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论遇到多么险阻的逆境，\r\n除了克服，没有其他选择。\r\n……其余的状况我一律不考虑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c81af7f74db28b4d15042d4ce79a0efb6386cbc10b7415d14c27b87fbf8ff2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd257acc6e4770dc76f8df46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……\r\n……得尽快重整身心状况。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e589d42017025cf9705db9c05495d802cd12376b83a670dd45a4a8b58a6b137",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02d8ed86e69d366211c50ef6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身为华丽一族，无论任何时候……\r\n都绝不可气馁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "42d9a91d185cf1c6f57c32f7817354112070a8a539376ffa32c373409c25edae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7492985b7e0828a0f0a4f3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6662d4dbec001753217e00827e1b11c773577bc67a31875f80338646c5f07bc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08100b156a2cc6dfd1861e39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50f188e86f3a8e4b11e3889195a5e78696dec7efbbec196eb54940fe3288b9a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a6442646e72896bac958bb2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请交给我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbccca85f058e7982fa407c9b21ad49d10f46f78cd350ee68ab04b7abed52c40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:339033db20fa77e6d5cf1019",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "092cd95e8a64d58d136c3c650b8d9d7cc23ad4ad69c0c649443874ffaa82fc65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eab8986be221b3cfa7913e31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88b08a445830f60f831cc69715bfe607a664dd20f0eb7a6b5add5663dfe83b11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f1957cf51ede49c070515a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为什么……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d8160a5d5173c64bf6663ecdf0abbdb4366485a3dfae0391cf8dc62dfd961ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba6ef42225788a3f168d99d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们出发吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3864e9473832146609b6ca6bdb0b249e490876d8260a714cff7a38028b9d836",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:155b986bc371422e38c1fcd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好美的地方……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7463d61fb27a90112327386267a1a98c9f41398967fbda780cfff03f7afc7d11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3799a0830ed0a359ea1fe6dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经看到你的觉悟了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8811783d6ef62344ca36a8f3453c0e1cb436bafa28f06a41fa00ff3b53d13fe9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbf36166108e6049dd252b29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢这段缘分。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13b97518e433937890fba002e879338ceb6d40e66cf3dc4b3517569607cb4bec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38802ca6bb30842f1aa3cf4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这也是我的职责。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98cace2535599b69272362579a7dd4eb7ca356d167c182784d00b0ee5cabf516",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a12e3c23d85f20f988f9667a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抬头挺胸，上场吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c1a3a21b9c1b3dd278436bb3ee2e6e0f8ceae566714bbf90920957dd9eb2f71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ddb410524815fc79b8a2af1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完成自己的职责吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "42d7f04e28c610ea6ae569b6911a33ac64b34a6e1c43c6e677bab6a02b249a5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e61c671ea007050653a5059",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢这段缘分。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13b97518e433937890fba002e879338ceb6d40e66cf3dc4b3517569607cb4bec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9955f119bc3d148f77eda7c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这一切都是为了我们华丽一族。\r\n母亲……我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cf23d3b509b33f43e78f9de5217421f47968d9b03e909b2c6270d67826ef588",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ddfadeb38a76e6114c71d59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标只有一个──绚烂的胜利。\r\n我会赢得与家族相衬的殊荣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5538e6fb09556d608bd629662a09aa1d1e3ad4ac68327c569d26e512523e9086",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4d80dbcf6e67137026d1990",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢这段缘分。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13b97518e433937890fba002e879338ceb6d40e66cf3dc4b3517569607cb4bec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:002911bdff22ade2b062180b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b59cda3dc4290a88197d0173",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次绝对只能获胜……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cfbb002d99b9242d7b3231bd1c8db7f491a93d7c9de199f91c4523494ab72be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7287d17800d44f9e8f57af3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还不够，还远远不够……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ee9a88a1c99f3e36b00591f363450a594f8e1e8e61b9356f76268f29b18951c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f3094a2103004102ebca65e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "至少，要抬头挺胸……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3c739315da04d1f889ea3d6409e5656ff98ed52cbcb37fb3158f1a5ec228525",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea5cf15eb6f915e8573b4ec7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我，做了什么……",
      "source_fingerprint": "54804eb73bcf183b8a75425724f3633f4c416581a30ca3849d5a7bac534d3b20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:812f03a37572bfebd8498020",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……累积更多荣耀，\r\n迈向理应抵达的完美。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23c66a11c5de069ca67e8848fc4010944ff9a6ac6576ea9c6467d6d989157d71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b21c044ef2c2a486b114796d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标只有至高无上的胜利。\r\n这是职责。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5caf7bf14c2083da1c52280a3bbca05c529927c27e8e9816266f0ebc25f4faa9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c1522b11d197d9ebcf361bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……护送的准备，做好了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "906b1a1c37a5d87ab20a87e697a6630b89fba69ff1f2b426745b2257f54feca4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6da4be7347caa1a467ee9b2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标唯有至高的胜利。这是我的职责。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5712789172096d7c653938b10712891549febc5ca8c0ee746d74426adea0ab7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca6ae29e6b8a13fbff9be481",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跑出最华丽的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ab22b493e4825ed30ccb46dd34c31b08e2ed117e188c4284533a2fce1b97ebf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:274ada8e67dbbb0634cc3af0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在正是绽放至高光芒之时……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab87e81ca2fed15d0a2df5b48f604a607f79b41cf67c358f6b447ee3d0954467",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93827fe0ca38b95c89851dde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "华丽的母亲的舞蹈。仿佛将整个场\n域的空气都变得清澈美丽……\n――这是我，所憧憬的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56c45b426f5d28d91e4c64e900138082ed834eaaa02aeaed53102a3232bcf0cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67a5fdb7a3ced2354ece5941",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「保持华丽。保持至高。\r\n时时刻刻绽放最耀眼的光芒」……\r\n意思是要亲手夺得鲜明的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1690335201d73f3ddef96659b892efabfdfa965924b5347f3d7278d6721b5d39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c106dd9f3f08c76c674ff8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们完成了应做之事。  \n所获得的东西弥足珍贵。  \n……对每个人而言，一定都是如此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "028112914fabfd3962bf3a21c3a846093c2e1a49be63f69c57b52fba9db85bf8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8160f3671d6a7f5ec0ce46a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我的热情将你染红……",
      "source_fingerprint": "158009dcd34236adc027d597c456bd0cc782064e1258f8bc1dbccea440b33bbf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae632390b1fc59f7927643a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "深沉、炽热、鲜明……  \n让我们用蔚蓝的火焰，为一切染上色彩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "441a431b355ebd9b4c6cc371770ebc7d7e221505b93185576dc66e78d94cf0f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47a5a07dfa8c4a90c4677f6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会华丽且优雅地，\r\n回应观众的声援。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8091ea8743b973a588210b0a0b1941ebec0ed2856bbbb6a125ddb950ead5441",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2afb3eaacbf8aaa37ba68d84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使并非身在赛场，\r\n我也理所当然做好了万全准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8aa2c495fe99d2cd603f86ef3212bdfb445b29b70a09a5d6b9d838e7a60a8369",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac4bdba25885343513f0e643",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我只追求最闪耀的光辉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60003f3550a68a82e1ebaac5ea086c15623eef6da1857e7575564e8b87ebf431",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41a2df8f47184210e2deee57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "选拔测验的内容\r\n当然都有背后的意义。\r\n而选拔理由也一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3699536852d2abfc7f171e949287fe3fc11b3d73e8b5c28cf2d3600168a8b12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65ffe5a70decd1dff3861563",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "表现出品格的设计……\r\n真不愧是名门特雷森学园。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a18d66765bacdcd4d297538909f57fa1ce735edb07a34d11fadb6b3258d22f1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0aceccb156e1e7e75727582f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这构造跟设计……让我感受到\r\n设计者为使身着之人能够更加\r\n华丽起舞的那份矜持。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06a27a1f7a5e9f8e22291706dabff59dbe6f43a2eef94ee9bf75b06863e543c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:257abf76c4472220ead7eb22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "视线向前，抬头挺胸。\r\n只要保持应有的姿态向前走就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcc70afa49793d695e647a1d825ee0b4c51c8fbd1f085777f510c642e0838fa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "70009"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
